WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,560
Yoyo, these are gifts from your uncle and aunt. See if you like them.

2
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:09,080
There are clothes, shoes, toys, and chocolates

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:15,200
Auntie, can you make a small request? Can I give you a hug?

4
00:00:15,200 --> 00:00:20,010
It seems, so soft

5
00:00:20,010 --> 00:00:23,010
All this should obviously belong to me

6
00:00:23,010 --> 00:00:30,220
Yoyo, why didn’t you tell your grandparents about your rescue yesterday?

7
00:00:30,220 --> 00:00:36,540
My sister is a little bit annoying and has an unusual talent.

8
00:00:37,910 --> 00:00:41,310
Accompanying the old man and the old lady, they never even said a word to accompany Jiaojiao.

9
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:45,860
I'm just afraid that being born is not as good as raising a family, poor little Youyou

10
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:49,100
Yoyo, uncle and aunt are coming today

11
00:00:49,100 --> 00:00:52,360
I want to invite you to our home

12
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:58,490
Are you willing to play with brother Wu Yao?

13
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:01,130
Our family usually has a relatively light diet.

14
00:01:01,130 --> 00:01:03,530
Get used to eating seasonal dishes and preparing tonic and medicinal diets

15
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:10,610
We prepared a super delicious mystery dish

16
00:01:10,610 --> 00:01:20,870
You have to go to our house to find out.

17
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:23,620
Old gentleman, old lady

18
00:01:23,700 --> 00:01:25,100
Let's come today

19
00:01:25,100 --> 00:01:27,780
I first wanted to invite Yoyo to our home as a guest

20
00:01:27,780 --> 00:01:31,580
Secondly, my grandfather, who is fine, will return from his travels soon.

21
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:33,500
If you don't dislike it

22
00:01:33,500 --> 00:01:37,600
We want to ask him to treat Mu Ye

23
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:40,840
What, seriously

24
00:01:40,840 --> 00:01:43,520
Ying Lao traveled incognito for several years

25
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,320
Even Ying's family has a hard time contacting him

26
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,840
If I can really hire Ying Lao this time,

27
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:51,560
Then Mr. Mu’s legs have a glimmer of muscle.
